  <jpcrp030000-asr_E03614-000:NotesRegardingSubordinatedLongTermLoansTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※２　1年内回収予定の関係会社長期貸付金及び関係会社長期貸付金は、劣後特約付貸付金であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E03614-000:NotesRegardingSubordinatedLongTermLoansTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingSubordinatedBondsPayableTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※３　1年内償還予定の社債及び社債には、劣後特約付社債が含まれております。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:457.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:196.2pt;min-width:196.2pt;"/&gt;
